"Frequently Asked Questions" = "Frequently Asked Questions";
"How do I play RoadTrip Royale?" = "How do I play RoadTrip Royale?";
"RoadTrip Royale is a license plate tracking game! During your road trips, keep an eye out for license plates from different states, provinces, or regions. When you spot one, use the app to mark it as found. You can use the List tab to manually select plates, or the Voice tab to speak the state/province name. Track your progress and see your collection grow on the interactive map!" = "RoadTrip Royale is a license plate tracking game! During your road trips, keep an eye out for license plates from different states, provinces, or regions. When you spot one, use the app to mark it as found. You can use the List tab to manually select plates, or the Voice tab to speak the state/province name. Track your progress and see your collection grow on the interactive map!";
"How do I create a trip?" = "How do I create a trip?";
"On the main screen, tap the 'Create Trip' button. You can give your trip a custom name, or leave it blank to use the date and time automatically. Once created, tap on the trip to start tracking license plates!" = "On the main screen, tap the 'Create Trip' button. You can give your trip a custom name, or leave it blank to use the date and time automatically. Once created, tap on the trip to start tracking license plates!";
"How does the Voice feature work?" = "How does the Voice feature work?";
"Tap the Voice tab, then press the microphone button. Speak the name of the state or province you see (e.g., 'California' or 'Ontario'). The app will listen and try to match what you said to a valid license plate region. If a match is found, you'll be asked to confirm before adding it to your collection." = "Tap the Voice tab, then press the microphone button. Speak the name of the state or province you see (e.g., 'California' or 'Ontario'). The app will listen and try to match what you said to a valid license plate region. If a match is found, you'll be asked to confirm before adding it to your collection.";
"Can I track plates from multiple countries?" = "Can I track plates from multiple countries?";
"Yes! RoadTrip Royale supports license plates from the United States, Canada, and Mexico. The map will automatically switch to show the correct country as you scroll through the list of regions." = "Yes! RoadTrip Royale supports license plates from the United States, Canada, and Mexico. The map will automatically switch to show the correct country as you scroll through the list of regions.";
"How do I see my progress?" = "How do I see my progress?";
"Each trip and each individual game has its own map and summary. On the trip or game screen, summary chips show how many plates you've found and how many remain. The map highlights found regions in yellow — tap it for a full-screen view." = "Each trip and each individual game has its own map and summary. On the trip or game screen, summary chips show how many plates you've found and how many remain. The map highlights found regions in yellow — tap it for a full-screen view.";
"Can I share my trips with others?" = "Can I share my trips with others?";
"Yes! You can invite friends to play with you on a trip, and after the trip is complete you can share the journey. Trips are stored both on your device and online when you're signed in, so you can keep playing offline and stay in sync when you reconnect." = "Yes! You can invite friends to play with you on a trip, and after the trip is complete you can share the journey. Trips are stored both on your device and online when you're signed in, so you can keep playing offline and stay in sync when you reconnect.";
"Collapses the answer" = "Collapses the answer";
"Expands the answer" = "Expands the answer";
"Do I need an internet connection?" = "Do I need an internet connection?";
"RoadTrip Royale works offline! You can create trips and track license plates without an internet connection. If you sign in with an account, your data will sync to the cloud when you're online." = "RoadTrip Royale works offline! You can create trips and track license plates without an internet connection. If you sign in with an account, your data will sync to the cloud when you're online.";

